{"3411740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Roadsters Odyssey", "steam_appid": 3411740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Game Play</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game Features Single player game mode of Survival, deathmatch and Deathrace and Team Deathmatch (Lan only) in demo mode, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will feature multiple game modes like Team Deathmatch, Deathrace, deathmatch, and survival and OpenWorld boss mode in the Pre alpha build. with more game modes in pipeline</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roadsters Odyssey is a vehicular combat game in active development and instead of hiding behind a trailer, we're putting the wheel in your hands from day one. The free demo is live now with three modes, real weapons, and AI rivals that fight back and Team Deathmatch (Lan only) against players</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game Features Single player game mode of Survival, deathmatch and Deathrace and Team Deathmatch (Lan only) against players in demo mode, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will feature multiple game modes like Team Deathmatch, Deathrace, deathmatch, and survival and OpenWorld boss mode in the Pre alpha build. with more game modes in pipeline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the foundation. The destruction gets bigger, the garage gets deeper, and online multiplayer is on the way. Play it now, shape it with us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏁 THREE WAYS TO PLAY TODAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Death Race: weaponized racing where overtaking and open fire are the same move</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/b54311043057c4663c7a0a85c4a954c2.poster.avif?t=1788245198\" width=1170 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/b54311043057c4663c7a0a85c4a954c2.webm?t=1788245198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/b54311043057c4663c7a0a85c4a954c2.mp4?t=1788245198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Deathmatch: pure vehicular combat against AI-driven rivals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/5e3abba28898a0be28016058c194a591.poster.avif?t=1788245198\" width=1170 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/5e3abba28898a0be28016058c194a591.webm?t=1788245198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/5e3abba28898a0be28016058c194a591.mp4?t=1788245198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Survival: outlast escalating waves of enemy machines for as long as your armor holds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/f61d7ae5e97a14c4adf38cd4238ceeb0.poster.avif?t=1788245198\" width=1170 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/f61d7ae5e97a14c4adf38cd4238ceeb0.webm?t=1788245198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3411740/extras/f61d7ae5e97a14c4adf38cd4238ceeb0.mp4?t=1788245198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=